--  Description:     -- Gadget active state controller--
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Methods defined:
--
--  Method call                      Return              Description
--  ===========                      ======              ===========
--  gadActCntrl(FORM)                -                   Constructor
--  process(ARRAY)                   BOOLEAN             Activates gadgets BEFORE the dash ('-') item
--  process(STRING)                  BOOLEAN             Activates gadgets BEFORE the dash ('-') item
--  process(STRING,STRING)           BOOLEAN             Activates gadgets BEFORE the dash ('-') item
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Copyright 1974 to current year. AVEVA Solutions Limited and its subsidiaries. All rights reserved in original code only.
--
-- File:            gadactcntrl.pmlobj
--   Type:          Object Definition
--   Group:         General Application
